---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Atelier Privacy Policy" description="Atelier collects no personal data. Everything stays on your iPhone.">
  <article class="container section mt-24 max-w-2xl space-y-6">
    <header class="space-y-2">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">Atelier Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-text-muted">Effective 15 November 2026</p>
    </header>

    <p>Atelier does not collect, store or share any personal data. Everything you create in the app stays on your iPhone.</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold pt-4">What stays on your device</h2>
    <p>Your decks, cards, images, audio and review history are saved only on your iPhone. They are included in your device backups if you use iCloud Backup or back up to a computer; those backups are handled by Apple under your own account and settings.</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold pt-4">No accounts, tracking or analytics</h2>
    <p>Atelier has no sign-in, no advertising, no analytics and no third-party code that tracks you. The app does not connect to the internet.</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold pt-4">Files and photos you choose</h2>
    <p>When you import a deck package or add a picture to a card, Atelier reads only the file or photo you pick and copies it into the app. It does not get access to the rest of your files or photo library.</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold pt-4">Spoken audio</h2>
    <p>Words are read aloud with the voices built into iOS, on your device.</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold pt-4">Deleting your data</h2>
    <p>You can delete cards and decks in the app at any time. Deleting Atelier removes all of its data from your iPhone.</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold pt-4">Children</h2>
    <p>Atelier collects no information from anyone, including children.</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold pt-4">Changes</h2>
    <p>If this policy changes, the new version will be posted on this page with a new effective date.</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold pt-4">Contact</h2>
    <p>Lintu Dev Studio · <a class="text-primary hover:underline" href="mailto:hello@lintu.dev">hello@lintu.dev</a></p>

    <p class="pt-4"><a class="text-primary hover:underline" href="/atelier/support">Atelier support</a></p>
  </article>
</Layout>
